OL,3,GNEWSACall to allow tractor transport
OL,4,Aservice for event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary public transport service
OL,7,Fcould run in Sark to support a
OL,8,Fmotorbike trials event taking place
OL,9,Fnext month.
OL,11,FSark in the Channel Islands is one of
OL,12,Fthe few places in the world where cars
OL,13,Fare banned with motor vehicles limited
OL,14,Fto quad bikes, tractors, mobility
OL,15,Fscooters and electric bikes.
OL,17,FThe only public transport for hire is a
OL,18,Ftractor that carries visitors up and
OL,19,Fdown Harbour Hill, but the trials event
OL,20,Fset for 10 and 11 October requires
OL,21,Fbikes and riders to be transported
OL,22,Fbetween the various stages.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
