OL,3,GNEWSACall to allow tractor transport
OL,4,Aservice for event
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island's Douzaine has asked Chief
OL,7,FPleas to approve a public transport
OL,8,Fservice for the duration of the event
OL,9,Fand said it was considering further
OL,10,Fchanges to the law to make the system
OL,11,Feasier.
